This is a rather large changeset with several changes in it. I implemented
in this manner (as opposed to a collection of smaller changes) to avoid
build breaks in intermediate commits in git bisections.

If needed, I can reimplement in several commits that makes sense
logically.

Also, I am not sure how maintainers will apply this patch. If
using git am, the --keep-cr should be used to accommodate the line
endings used in EDK2.
 
